  <li><p>
the paper by Bondal and Kapranov, see <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Bondal-Kapranov">Bondal-Kapranov</a>]</span> 
</p>
</li><li><p>
the paper by Bondal and Orlov, see <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Bondal-Orlov">Bondal-Orlov</a>]</span> 
</p>
</li><li><p>
the paper by Bondal and Van den Bergh, see <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/BvdB">BvdB</a>]</span> 
</p>
</li><li><p>
the papers by Beilinson, see <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Beilinson">Beilinson</a>]</span> and <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Beilinson-derived">Beilinson-derived</a>]</span> 
</p>
</li><li><p>
the paper by Orlov, see <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Orlov-AV">Orlov-AV</a>]</span> 
</p>
</li><li><p>
the paper by Orlov, see <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Orlov-motives">Orlov-motives</a>]</span> 
</p>
</li><li><p>
the paper by Rouquier, see <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Rouquier-dimensions">Rouquier-dimensions</a>]</span> 
